# `collections.get`

Collection schema and item count.

**Policy** — read (C0, safe). Capability `ship.collection.read`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `id` | `string` |

## Returns

`CollectionDetail` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `id` | `string` |
| `schema_json` | `string` |
| `item_count` | `number` |

## Invoke

```
